'''Bacte''' is the second boss in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It requires the [[Living Timecharm]]. It can be fought in the {{Zone|Colosseum (Rift)}}. 

== Spawning ==
'''Bacte''' starts out as a Slime named '''B''' in the center of the {{Zone|Colosseum (Rift)}}. The player can start the boss fight by punching all of the [[Globowl]]s in the arena into '''B'''.

'''B''' and the Globowls will respawn after 3 minutes and 30 seconds counting from boss disappearing from arena.

