== Behavior ==
While in the boss fight, the player will die if they go outside the arena for more than about 3 seconds. '''Bacte''' will despawn if no players are in the arena.

'''Bacte''' is invulnerable for most of the boss fight. There are 5 phases of the fight, which start when '''Bacte''' has {{Stat|hp|1,000}}, {{Stat|hp|800}}, {{Stat|hp|600}}, {{Stat|hp|400}}, and {{Stat|hp|200}}. At the start of each phase after the first, the next letter of '''Bacte's''' name will be revealed. During each phase, '''Bacte''' will root an increasing amount of tentacles into the ground, which can only be damaged by Globowls. They have {{Hp|4}} in the first 3 phases, and {{Hp|3}} in phase 4. After a tentacle is destroyed, a [[Blobbercyst]] will spawn at its location. After each tentacle and Blobbercyst is destroyed, '''Bacte''' will shrink down, and can be damaged by players, until the next phase starts or '''Bacte''' is killed.

During the phases, '''Bacte''' will use the following attacks:
* '''Spikes Pandemoglob''' ('''Spike''') - Creates spikes of slime that rise from the floor of the arena, taking {{Stat|rt|20s}} from players they come in contact with and knocking them high into the air.
* '''Malign Sliceline''' ('''Slice''') - Creates a border in a half or quarter of the arena (the {{Green|Safe Slice}}), and starts a countdown of a few seconds. If the player is not within the area when the countdown ends, they will lose {{Stat|rt|30s}}.
* '''Slimecopter''' - Creates a line of slime that spins around '''Bacte'''. It takes {{Stat|rt|10s}} from players it comes in contact with and knocks them into the air.

'''Bacte''' will use more attacks the further into the boss fight the player is.
* '''Phase 1''': '''B''' will not use any attacks, and spawn 1 tentacle.
* '''Phase 2''': '''Ba''' will cast '''Spikes Pandemoglob''', before spawning 2 tentacles.
* '''Phase 3''': '''Bac''' will cast '''Malign Sliceline''', then '''Spikes Pandemoglob''', before spawning 3 tentacles.
* '''Phase 4''': '''Bact''' will cast '''Slimecopter''', which will reverse 4 times and speed up 3 times, before slowing down. It will then cast '''Spikes Pandemoglob''' and '''Malign Sliceline''', before summoning 4 tentacles, which all have {{HP|3}}.
* '''Phase 5''': '''Bacte''' will cast an unnamed spell, which will turn the arena into Slime Blocks, and the player will begin to bounce very high. They can left click to use their Blaster, which deals one damage to tentacles. '''Bacte''' will use '''Spikes Pandemoglob''', '''Malign Sliceline''', and '''Slimecopter''', before spawning 6 tentacles, with each having {{HP|20}}. Blobbercysts will not spawn during this phase, but Globowls sometimes can due to a bug.

Once the tentacles are rooted into the ground, the frequency of '''Malign Sliceline''' attacks is reduced, and players have 8 seconds instead of 5 seconds to get to the safe slice.

== Tips ==

* It is highly recommended to gather a few people beforehand, as it greatly speeds up the battle.
* Blobbercysts take 100 damage if a Globowl is pushed towards them.  If done consistently, this is quicker than melee, and can be used to kill them without walking towards them.
* Server-hopping is a valid method of gaining fragments quicker, at the cost of bits.

