== Trivia ==
* '''Bacte''' is a clear reference to [[Dante]].
* According to [[Elise (Rift)|Elise]], either '''Bacte''' or Dante may have originated from the other. Additionally, Shen may have found Dante in the Rift.
* Using the command {{Code|/killbacte}}, a reference to [[Commands#Removed Commands|{{Code|/killdante}}]], will make the following message appear in chat: {{Dialogue|
&2{{Dashline}}
&a&lBACTE HAS NOT BEEN DEFEATED
&eThis command has been ran &a[#] &etimes!
&7Hopefully those players felt bad [#] times about it. >:[
&2{{Dashline}}|class=centertext
}}
** Occasionally, it may show the following message instead if the kill count hasn't been loaded yet: {{Dialogue|
&2{{Dashline}}
&a&lBACTE HAS NOT BEEN DEFEATED
&eThis command has been ran many times!
&7Hopefully those players felt bad about it. >:[
&2{{Dashline}}|class=centertext
}}

*Everyone who qualified for the fragment reward rolls the chance for the dye, no matter the damage or boss stage of entering the arena.
*Completing the fight rewards {{Motes|6000}}, and killing the Bacte mob rewards {{Motes|4000}}, even through lootshare for a total of {{Motes|10000}}.

